Chickens
	White Chicken														🗹
		Needs: Coop
		Source: Marnie's Ranch chosen at random at purchase
	Brown Chicken														🗹
		Needs: Coop
		Source: Marnie's Ranch chosen at random at purchase
	Blue Chicken
		Needs: Coop
		Source: Marnie's Ranch chosen at random at purchase
		Unlocked after: seeing Shane's 8-heart event
	Void Chicken
		Needs: Big Coop
		Source: Hatched by placing a Void Egg into an Incubator
		Void Egg: Sold by Krobus for 5,000g
	Golden Chicken
		Needs: Big Coop && Perfection
		Source: Hatched by placing a Golden Egg into an Incubator
		Golden Egg: Sold at Marnie's Ranch for 100,000g

Dinosaur
	Needs: Big Coop
	Source: Hatched by placing a Dinosaur Egg into an Incubator

Needs
	6 Golden Animal Crackers

Steps
	Build Coop							🗹
	Upgrade Coop to Big Coop			🗹
	Buy White Chicken					🗹
	Buy Brown Chicken					🗹
	↘️
	Trigger Shane's 8-heart event
	Buy Blue Chicken
	↘️
	Buy Void Egg
	Hatch Void Chicken
	↘️
	◀️Reach Perfection
	Buy Golden Egg
	Hatch Golden Chicken
	↘️
